  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n∠BIC - ∠BOC = 90°\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n∠BIC = 90 + A/2\n\n∠BOC = 180 - A\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (90 + A/2) - (180 - A) = 90\n\n⇒ 90 + A/2 - 180 + A = 90\n\n⇒ -90 + 3A/2 = 90\n\n⇒ 3A/2 = 180\n\n⇒ A = 120°\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 120°.**",
